<view class="companion-page" style="padding-top:{{topInset}}px"
  ><view class="companion-header"
    ><button bindtap="back" aria-label="返回伙伴小屋">
      <t-icon name="chevron-left" size="25px" /></button
    ><text>伙伴资料卡</text></view
  ><view class="companion-card"
    ><view class="companion-row"
      ><view
        wx:if="{{petCropped}}"
        class="companion-sprite-preview card-avatar"
        style="{{petPreviewStyle}}"
      ></view
      ><image wx:elif="{{petSrc}}" class="card-avatar" src="{{petSrc}}" mode="aspectFit" /><view
        wx:else
        class="companion-placeholder companion-placeholder--pet"
        >校园伙伴</view
      ><view class="card-summary"
        ><text class="companion-title">{{state.name || '校园伙伴'}}</text
        ><text class="companion-muted">初次见面 {{birthday}}</text
        ><text class="companion-muted"
          >陪伴 {{days}} 天 · 收藏 {{state.ownedSkins.length || 0}} 个形象</text
        ></view
      ></view
    ><text class="companion-kicker">{{characterRole}}</text
    ><text class="companion-copy">{{characterLine}}</text
    ><text class="companion-muted">{{characterPersonality}}</text></view
  >
  <text wx:if="{{actionMessage}}" class="companion-message">{{actionMessage}}</text
  ><view class="companion-card"
    ><text class="companion-title">我们的小设定</text
    ><text class="companion-muted">只用于伙伴角色设定，不用于判断你的真实性格。</text
    ><text class="companion-copy">伙伴名字</text
    ><input
      class="companion-input"
      aria-label="伙伴名字"
      value="{{nameInput}}"
      maxlength="16"
      disabled="{{busy}}"
      bindinput="nameChanged"
    /><text class="companion-copy">角色性格</text
    ><picker
      aria-label="伙伴角色性格"
      disabled="{{busy}}"
      value="{{mbtiIndex}}"
      range="{{mbtiLabels}}"
      bindchange="mbtiChanged"
      ><view class="companion-choice"
        >{{mbtiInput || '暂不设置'}} <t-icon name="chevron-right" size="15px" /></view></picker
    ><text class="companion-copy">小院场景</text
    ><view class="companion-row"
      ><button
        wx:for="{{themes}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="theme-option {{themeInput===item.id?'theme-option--selected':''}}"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        aria-label="{{item.name + (themeInput === item.id ? '，已选择' : '')}}"
        disabled="{{busy}}"
        style="background:{{item.color}}"
        bindtap="themeChanged"
      >
        {{item.name}}
      </button></view
    ><view class="companion-switch-row"
      ><text>在日记页显示小屋入口</text
      ><switch
        aria-label="在日记页显示小屋入口"
        disabled="{{busy}}"
        checked="{{showOnJournal}}"
        color="#728c5e"
        bindchange="widgetChanged" /></view
    ><view class="companion-switch-row"
      ><text>轻触反馈</text
      ><switch
        aria-label="轻触反馈"
        disabled="{{busy}}"
        checked="{{haptics}}"
        color="#728c5e"
        bindchange="hapticsChanged" /></view
    ><button
      class="companion-primary"
      loading="{{busy}}"
      disabled="{{busy || !state.adoptedAt}}"
      bindtap="savePreferences"
    >
      保存伙伴资料
    </button></view
  >
  <view class="companion-card companion-publication"
    ><text class="companion-title">好友来做客</text
    ><view
      class="publication-status publication-status--{{cloudPhase}}"
      role="status"
      aria-live="polite"
      ><text class="publication-status__dot" aria-hidden="true">●</text
      ><text>{{cloudStatus}}</text></view
    ><text wx:if="{{cloudError}}" class="publication-error" role="status">{{cloudError}}</text
    ><text class="companion-muted"
      >开放后仅展示伙伴名字、形象和布置；好友身份每次访问都要重新验证。布置变更后可手动同步。</text
    ><button
      class="companion-primary"
      disabled="{{busy || !state.adoptedAt || cloudWasUsed && !cloudKnown}}"
      loading="{{cloudPhase==='opening' || cloudPhase==='closing'}}"
      bindtap="publishHome"
    >
      {{cloudPhase==='opening'?'正在开放小屋…':cloudPhase==='closing'?'正在关闭来访…':cloudKnown &&
      visibility==='friends'?'关闭好友来访':'主动开放给现有好友'}}</button
    ><button
      class="companion-secondary publication-refresh"
      disabled="{{busy || cloudPhase==='checking'}}"
      loading="{{cloudPhase==='checking'}}"
      bindtap="refreshCloudStatus"
    >
      {{cloudPhase==='checking'?'正在核对…':'重新核对开放状态'}}</button
    ><button
      wx:if="{{cloudKnown && visibility==='friends'}}"
      class="companion-secondary"
      disabled="{{busy}}"
      bindtap="syncHome"
    >
      同步当前本机布置</button
    ><button
      wx:if="{{cloudKnown && visibility==='friends'}}"
      class="companion-secondary"
      open-type="share"
      disabled="{{busy}}"
    >
      分享好友小屋入口</button
    ><button
      wx:if="{{cloudWasUsed}}"
      class="companion-link"
      disabled="{{busy}}"
      bindtap="deletePublishedHome"
    >
      删除云端小屋与来访记录
    </button></view
  ><text class="companion-muted"
    >养成、签到、光点和仓库保存在本机。云端只保存你主动展示的小屋外观及来访记录。</text
  ></view
>
